# No Absolute Paths in Documentation
RULE: All paths in codex and PM docs must be workspace-relative. Never use /Users/..., /home/..., /data/..., $HOME/...
WHY: Absolute paths make docs machine-specific and stale.
DO: `cd instruments-service`; `python market-tick-data-service/scripts/validate.py`
NEVER: `/Users/.../instruments-service`; `$UNIFIED_TRADING_WORKSPACE_ROOT/...`
